# MinIO / Files

Buckets are private by default. Use signed URLs — no unrestricted public buckets.

## Abstraction

Reuse or extend a single storage service:

```text
upload · download · delete · exists · getSignedUrl
```

Metadata in PostgreSQL; binary objects in MinIO. Never store large image binaries in Postgres.

## Uploads

Validate MIME, size limits, and filenames. Never trust client-provided names or content types.
